cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evaluation protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Graph Neural Network and Transformer Fusion for Molecular Property Prediction: What a Strict Evaluation Protocol Finds"
abstract: >-
  An evaluation protocol for multi-view molecular property prediction, and a fusion
  architecture measured under it. Eight MoleculeNet datasets, six scaffold splits, paired
  comparisons with family-wise correction and an across-dataset test, split-conformal
  uncertainty, and machine-checked reproducibility gates. Reports negative results: the
  proposed architecture does not beat a descriptor MLP, a 16,513-parameter gate matches a
  1,169,793-parameter fusion block, two published external baselines are indistinguishable
  from a two-layer graph network, and the significance of the paper's own mechanism claim
  is not stable to an architectural constant.
type: software

